# COMPONENT

## TextusControlCenter

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.controlcenter

### DESCRIPTION

Textus Control Center CAR bundle root for the launcher-started Subsystem inventory.

### COMPONENTLET

#### public-subsystem-inventory

#### subsystem-inventory-admin

# COMPONENTLET

## public-subsystem-inventory

- component :: TextusControlCenter
- kind :: participant

### DESCRIPTION

Machine-facing Subsystem registration participant.

# COMPONENTLET

## subsystem-inventory-admin

- component :: TextusControlCenter
- kind :: participant

### DESCRIPTION

Human-facing Subsystem inventory administration participant.

# SERVICE

## SubsystemInventory

### DESCRIPTION

Versioned launcher registration and administrative inventory operations.

### OPERATION

#### registerSubsystem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates or idempotently refreshes one launcher-owned Subsystem instance.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RegisterSubsystem

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RegisterSubsystemResult

#### heartbeatSubsystem

##### DESCRIPTION

Refreshes one registered launcher-owned Subsystem instance.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

HeartbeatSubsystem

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

HeartbeatSubsystemResult

#### deregisterSubsystem

##### DESCRIPTION

Records normal termination without deleting the Subsystem instance.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

DeregisterSubsystem

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

DeregisterSubsystemResult

#### listSubsystems

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists registered Subsystem instances for human administration.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListSubsystems

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ListSubsystemsResult

#### getSubsystem

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one registered Subsystem instance for human administration.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetSubsystem

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

GetSubsystemResult

# SERVICE

## CarCatalog

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative managed-CAR catalog operations backed by persisted source snapshots.

### OPERATION

#### refreshCarCatalog

##### DESCRIPTION

Refreshes explicitly configured CAR sources without changing CAR lifecycle state.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RefreshCarCatalog

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RefreshCarCatalogResult

#### listManagedCars

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists persisted managed CAR identities and safe source availability summaries.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListManagedCars

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ListManagedCarsResult

#### getManagedCar

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one managed CAR and its protected source snapshot detail.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetManagedCar

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

GetManagedCarResult

# SERVICE

## OperationalManagement

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative operating-target records derived from catalog sources and accepted launcher use.

### OPERATION

#### listOperationalComponents

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists components retained in standalone operational management.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListOperationalComponents

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ListOperationalComponentsResult

### OPERATION

#### getOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one operating-target record and its current safe management projection.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

GetOperationalComponentResult

### OPERATION

#### removeOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Excludes an operating target without stopping its currently running instances.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RemoveOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RemoveOperationalComponentResult

### OPERATION

#### restoreOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Restores an explicitly excluded operating target when supported source or use evidence exists.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RestoreOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RestoreOperationalComponentResult

# SERVICE

## LifecycleControl

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative lifecycle requests for managed operational components. The local launcher supervisor owns process execution.

### OPERATION

#### startOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Requests a start from the selected local launcher supervisor.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

StartOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

StartOperationalComponentResult

### OPERATION

#### stopOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Requests a stop from the selected local launcher supervisor.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

StopOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

StopOperationalComponentResult

### OPERATION

#### restartOperationalComponent

##### DESCRIPTION

Requests a restart from the selected local launcher supervisor.

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

RestartOperationalComponent

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

RestartOperationalComponentResult

### OPERATION

#### listLifecycleRequests

##### DESCRIPTION

Lists safe lifecycle request audit projections for one managed component.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListLifecycleRequests

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ListLifecycleRequestsResult

### OPERATION

#### getLifecycleRequest

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one safe lifecycle request audit projection.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetLifecycleRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

GetLifecycleRequestResult

# ENTITY

## RegisteredSubsystem

### ATTRIBUTE

| name                    | type                    | multiplicity | confidentiality |
|-------------------------|-------------------------|--------------|-----------------|
| id                      | entityid                | 1            |                 |
| instanceId              | SubsystemInstanceId     | 1            |                 |
| protocolVersion         | int                     | 1            |                 |
| launcherKind            | LauncherKind            | 1            |                 |
| target                  | SubsystemTarget         | 1            |                 |
| artifactId              | ManagedCarArtifactId    | ?            |                 |
| executionMode           | ExecutionMode           | ?            |                 |
| developmentDirectory    | DevelopmentDirectory    | ?            |                 |
| subsystemName           | SubsystemName           | ?            |                 |
| subsystemVersion        | SubsystemVersion        | ?            |                 |
| runtimeVersion          | RuntimeVersion          | ?            |                 |
| baseUrl                 | SubsystemBaseUrl        | 1            |                 |
| hostLabel               | HostLabel               | 1            |                 |
| startedAt               | instant                 | 1            |                 |
| lastSeenAt              | instant                 | 1            |                 |
| launcherState           | LauncherState           | 1            |                 |
| registrationPrincipalId | RegistrationPrincipalId | 1            | internal        |

